1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,700
Six months ago a guy here gave me
a bottle of wine on credit.

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,020
I came to pay him back.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,340
Old Karl?

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,000
He left in the summer.

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,660
Moved to Graz, I think.

6
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,740
Oh.

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:17,920
Well, then I guess the debt goes
to whoever's standing here.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,140
Then it was a very good wine.

9
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,440
What was the occasion?

10
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,280
I'm still finding out.

11
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,400
She's supposed to meet me tonight.
